<%# How this deployment's X consent will finish, read off the live redirect URI. %>
<% redirect_uri = XOauthBootstrap.default_redirect_uri %>
<p>
  Zimmer sends you to X to approve <code><%= XOauthBootstrap::SCOPES %></code>, then exchanges the code X
  returns for a refresh token. Nothing in the scope lets the token post publicly.
</p>
<% if XOauthBootstrap.manual_completion_required?(redirect_uri) %>
  <p>
    X will redirect to <code><%= redirect_uri %></code>, which Zimmer does not serve, so the page after
    this one asks you to paste that URL back. Register <code><%= XOauthBootstrap.hosted_redirect_uri %></code>
    on the X app and set <code><%= XOauthBootstrap::REDIRECT_URI_ENV %></code> to it to skip the paste.
  </p>
<% else %>
  <p>X will redirect back to <code><%= redirect_uri %></code>, and the credential is stored there.</p>
<% end %>
